{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XYqUOckPqayW1QoIYTLN7w?scene=1&click_id=1","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:47.313784+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XYqUOckPqayW1QoIYTLN7w?scene=1&click_id=1","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/5WXQA7ic7tkPlLicvLXEa7MUaD3gqFd4FWZZ0pcVVpD5NtIwkCZjVhaI4RhOLLXORicxx8IuEBnxFhvHuJwvpVv1g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>中山大学附属第六医院（简称“中山六院”）位于广东省省会城市广州，地处粤港澳大湾区核心地带，是一所国内知名的以“大专科、强综合”为特色的大型综合性三甲医院，2021至2023年度连续3年国家公立医院绩效考核蝉联A+等级，跻身全国“百强”。获评医疗机构最佳雇主新锐医院10强。医院连续两年入选中国研究型医院，2023年度中国医院科技量值（STEM）普通外科学排名广东第1（全国第16），消化病学（广东第4，全国第26）、肿瘤学等7个学科进入全国前百创下新高。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>医院医疗技术力量雄厚，现拥有国家临床重点专科，教育部重点实验室、广东省重点实验室，国内最高水平之一的结直肠肿瘤、胃肿瘤会诊诊治中心，胃肠肛门专科、生殖医学等学科具有全国影响力，是广东省的一张特色医疗名片。医院现有员村院本部金融城院区、知识城院区及珠吉院区（在建）3个院区，院区间错位布局，优势互补，协同发展，助推高水平医院建设。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/5WXQA7ic7tkPlLicvLXEa7MUaD3gqFd4FWs4Anv0fMGFsRdiaELiatzBVURHicNtdKthSMl3iasADjdgxdKDkgiaj1BWw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>医院现组织开展2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读研究生预报名工作，欢迎符合申请条件的优秀学子（包括本校应届生）踊跃报名！</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>一、申请条件</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（一）中华人民共和国公民；</span></p><p><span>（二）拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></p><p><span>（三）在目前就读学校取得教育部推荐免试研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></p><p><span>（四）学术研究兴趣浓厚，具有较强的创新意识、创新能力和作为博士、硕士研究生培养的潜质；</span></p><p><span>（五）诚实守信，学风端正，未受过任何处分；</span></p><p><span>（六）身体健康状况符合国家和中山大学规定的体检要求；</span></p><p><span>（七）入学前须本科毕业并获得学士学位；</span></p><p><span>（八）申请医学学位推免生，申请条件除符合上述（一）至（七）项要求外，还须符合以下要求：</span></p><p><span>1. 医学临床学科（1002临床医学、1003口腔医学、1006中西医结合）学术学位各专业只接受授医学学位的应届本科毕业生申请。</span></p><p><span>2. 临床医学硕士专业学位只接受本科毕业于5年及以上学制的临床医学、麻醉学、精神医学、医学影像学、放射医学、眼视光医学、儿科学等专业的应届本科毕业生申请。</span></p><p><span>3. 口腔医学硕士专业学位只接受5年制口腔医学专业的应届本科毕业生申请。</span></p><p><span>4. 被录取为临床医学、口腔医学专业学位的学生均须参加住院医师规范化培训。我院不接受入学前已获得住院医师规范化培训合格证书的考生报考临床（口腔）医学硕士专业学位。</span></p><p><span>（九）其余申请条件要符合中山大学推荐免试研究生招生章程及接收办法中的要求。</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>二、招生专业</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>我院拟招生专业请见推免生预报名系统</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>https://enroll.sysu.edu.cn/</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>说明：实际招生专业以学校最终公布的2026年研究生招生专业目录为准。各专业实际接收推免生人数将根据招生计划、生源情况等进行调整，以实际录取为准。</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>三、申请材料</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1、个人简历（限2页以内，扫描PDF版）；</span></p><p><span>2、身份证PDF扫描件（正反面复印在一页A4纸上）；</span></p><p><span>3、加盖有效注册印章的在校学生证PDF扫描件；</span></p><p><span>4、加盖教务部门公章的本科阶段成绩单及成绩总评证明PDF扫描件；</span></p><p><span>5、英语水平证明材料（英语四/六级或TOEFL、IELTS、GRE、GMAT等体现自身英语水平的考试成绩单PDF扫描件）；</span></p><p><span>6、公开发表的文章PDF扫描件（需标注出个人姓名）；</span></p><p><span>7、负责或参与的科研项目PDF扫描件（含项目书盖章页、参与人信息页）；</span></p><p><span>8、各类获奖证书PDF扫描件；</span></p><p><span>9、其他辅助材料等。</span></p><p><span>申请者须承诺所提供信息、材料及申请身份的真实性。一经查证为不属实或不符合我校招生要求的，我校将取消其申请资格、录取资格、入学资格，已入学的取消学籍。</span></p><p><span>申请者若存在有违学术道德、专业伦理、诚实守信等方面的不当行为，一经查实，立即取消其申请资格、录取资格、入学资格，已入学的取消学籍。</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>四、申请流程</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>推免生的预报名及考核录取均通过中山大学推荐免试攻读研究生预报名系统（以下简称“预推免系统”，网址: https://enroll.sysu.edu.cn/）进行。</span></p><p><span>1、申请者须即日起在“预推免系统”完成网上报名。</span><strong><span><span>截止报名时间：2025年9月17日24:00</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>2、</span><span><strong><span>请申请者密切关注我院在“预推免系统”及医院官网：https://www.sysu6h.cn公布的相关信息</span></strong></span><span>。</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>五、初审与考核</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span> 1.我院对申请材料初审后，通知初审通过的申请人参加复试的时间和具体流程。</span></p><p><span> 2.复试时间：</span><span><strong><span>即日起至9月22日期间分批组织复试录取工作</span></strong></span><span>。具体复试录取时间由各复试组自行确定。请推免生源密切留意我院发出的相关复试通知。</span></p><p><span> 3.复试方式：线下面试。申请人须按学校及我院报考要求做好复试准备工作，按时参加复试。</span></p><p><span>4.复试原则上实行差额复试，择优录取。直博生及免试硕士生分别排序，免试硕士生学术学位及专业学位考生按成绩从高到低分别排序。复试以面试为主，重点考察外语应用能力、专业素质及能力、实践（实验）能力、思想政治素质和品德、心理健康状况等，复试小组对参加复试的考生逐个进行考核。考核教师提问，考生当场回答的方式进行。复试成绩外语应用能力考核占30分，专业及综合能力考核占70分，满分为100分，60分合格，复试不合格者不予录取。思想品德考核不合格者不予录取。</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>六、其他</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.说明</span></p><p><span>此通知为预报名通知，具体要求以教育部及中山大学2026年推荐免试研究生接收工作相关通知、接收办法通知为准。</span></p><p><span>推免生的报名及录取均通过教育部“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”，网址: https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/）进行。所有推免生（含“免试硕士生”和“直博生”）均需按照教育部、本科所在学校和省市招办要求在规定时间内登录教育部推荐免试服务系统，完成资格审查、填报志愿、缴纳报名费、接受复试确认、接受待录取确认等环节。</span></p><p><span>推免复审及体检要求请留意学校及院系后续发布的推免接收办法及相关通知。</span></p><p><span>2.联系方式</span></p><p><span>（1）联系人：姚老师、李老师</span></p><p><span>（2）联系电话：020-38254159</span></p><p><span>（3）邮箱：zslyyjs@mail.sysu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>（4）通信地址：广州市天河区员村二横路26号中山大学附属第六医院1号楼29楼2915室学历教育科，邮编：510655</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>责任编辑：刘山青</span></p><p><span>初审：戴希安</span></p><p><span>审核：乐虞莹、简文杨</span></p><p><span>终审：李文敏</span></p><p><span>审定发布：李汉荣</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>推荐阅读</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>✦</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4NTIxMzAyOA==&amp;mid=2650136132&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=dd9bc9512e8e8bc78d9e8497d76bbebb&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4NTIxMzAyOA==&amp;mid=2650136132&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=dd9bc9512e8e8bc78d9e8497d76bbebb&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\"><section><section><span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/5WXQA7ic7tkPs0k46sSRxJL9422vluU6NMk7j5gY7KBl272UVhzTOAogtX5r2MRQR5dg4wtNr1Nz1gbcxFJ7Asw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></span></section></section></a><section><section><p><span><span>► </span></span><span><span>JAMA发表！中山六院汪建平、康亮团队提供全球首个关于“经肛腔镜直肠癌根治手术”的高级别证据</span></span></p></section></section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4NTIxMzAyOA==&amp;mid=2650140067&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=761aca60a03ead733df44850ce2850e6&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4NTIxMzAyOA==&amp;mid=2650140067&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=761aca60a03ead733df44850ce2850e6&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\"><section><section><span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/5WXQA7ic7tkPs0k46sSRxJL9422vluU6NM2KVfbj4ibw0ibvIwqBvmm5GenBu8ibnd9LIsL4z9knmdKXBO6vE6Frbg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></span></section></section></a><section><section><p><span><span>► </span></span><span><span>中六扬帆，“知”启新程：中山大学附属第六医院知识城院区正式启用！</span></span></p></section></section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4NTIxMzAyOA==&amp;mid=2650096327&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=97b4ca5d4a568254d0aa202800a24d50&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4NTIxMzAyOA==&amp;mid=2650096327&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=97b4ca5d4a568254d0aa202800a24d50&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\"><section><section><span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/5WXQA7ic7tkPs0k46sSRxJL9422vluU6NXDicHSVC76qCAWDCvK5ibJpLeFZm1W0AfU0M2sbUh1nIwoyxeUicJyoTg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></span></section></section></a><section><section><p><span><span>► </span></span><span><span>全国百强！热烈祝贺我院2022年度全国公立医院绩效考核蝉联A+！</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/5WXQA7ic7tkPSv5owWq7g8BEGZII7U3L2Va38oI5sibQVlVYzyD0bLJ1egw8E4EN3FdQ0XTgR6Y5Ho9yXWz3Gjlw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></span></p><p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XYqUOckPqayW1QoIYTLN7w?scene=1&amp;click_id=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/5WXQA7ic7tkPSv5owWq7g8BEGZII7U3L2Wvia7oMdf7sesApY8muFurKibXh7wBLXNZkLVoqX8wAPFFlKk3ibbGHaQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></a></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/5WXQA7ic7tkPSv5owWq7g8BEGZII7U3L2sibM60oTCTZhFbiadJNSjcZVeZ4gwc5IRzawumQ3zpcfTteNqVlSDkiaA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/5WXQA7ic7tkPSv5owWq7g8BEGZII7U3L2G3h5x1Hic9Kug9HQ3j5G3svLYdtIR7bGOzFOBqsUic3ETMSrwibLyxicpQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></span></p><p></p></div>","textSha256":"a56d63e26fc6665da16b775ef270df2765d6b42ab471943d9944d4194cc1888e","textLength":2630,"sourceSha256":"941468fdd97b3c4b01b91165f5c075bed0ed2befaa67237d10b90b34b789f372","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c299f47a9608ea48927b","title":"2025年中山大学附属第六医院2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读研究生预报名开始","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:47.313784+00:00"}
